637
00:28:23,830 --> 00:28:24,720
Look, there he is.

638
00:28:24,720 --> 00:28:25,350
Over there.

639
00:28:25,350 --> 00:28:25,880
Yes, yes.

640
00:28:26,030 --> 00:28:27,400
It's great that our son is in lane six.

641
00:28:27,400 --> 00:28:29,300
Six is a lucky number.
