669
00:29:27,160 --> 00:29:28,070
Of course, of course.

670
00:29:28,070 --> 00:29:28,400
Okay.

671
00:29:28,960 --> 00:29:30,220
When my son comes back,

672
00:29:31,270 --> 00:29:32,070
I'll host a banquet.

673
00:29:32,070 --> 00:29:32,830
Everyone come,

674
00:29:32,830 --> 00:29:33,360
