746
00:32:22,920 --> 00:32:24,580
And he'd come home with a zero.

747
00:32:25,330 --> 00:32:26,990
Can't you say something nice?

748
00:32:28,310 --> 00:32:29,270
It's different. Right, right.

749
00:32:29,270 --> 00:32:30,180
My bad, my bad.

750
00:32:30,850 --> 00:32:31,400
Here.

751
00:32:31,830 --> 00:32:32,230
Here's

752
00:32:34,110 --> 00:32:35,270
to our girl.

753
00:32:36,240 --> 00:32:37,070
May you

754
00:32:37,400 --> 00:32:38,680
ace the exam

755
00:32:39,440 --> 00:32:40,770
and get a perfect score.

756
00:32:41,310 --> 00:32:42,170
How about that?

757
00:32:42,350 --> 00:32:43,160
Absolutely.

758
00:32:43,880 --> 00:32:45,640
Zhi is a provincial champion.

759
00:32:46,160 --> 00:32:47,170
So my goal

760
00:32:47,200 --> 00:32:48,970
