768
00:33:02,480 --> 00:33:03,140
Here you go.

769
00:33:03,720 --> 00:33:04,840
I already checked them.

770
00:33:04,840 --> 00:33:05,720
And the essential balm.

771
00:33:05,720 --> 00:33:06,720
It's hot today.

772
00:33:06,750 --> 00:33:07,920
Remember to apply some if you get sleepy.

773
00:33:07,920 --> 00:33:08,640
Here.

774
00:33:09,640 --> 00:33:10,400
That's enough.

775
00:33:10,400 --> 00:33:12,200
Eat until you're about 70% full.

776
00:33:12,270 --> 00:33:13,880
Too much and you'll get sleepy.

777
00:33:13,880 --> 00:33:15,110
It'll affect your performance.

778
00:33:15,110 --> 00:33:15,720
Grandpa.

779
00:33:17,730 --> 00:33:18,830
I wasn't nervous at all.

780
00:33:18,830 --> 00:33:19,740
But with all of you doing this,

781
00:33:19,740 --> 00:33:21,200
