785
00:33:26,790 --> 00:33:28,250
Stay calm and do your best.

786
00:33:28,830 --> 00:33:29,750
But you guys aren't treating it

787
00:33:29,750 --> 00:33:30,680
like a mock exam.

788
00:33:30,880 --> 00:33:31,880
Look at all of you.

789
00:33:33,030 --> 00:33:33,440
Xin,

790
00:33:33,680 --> 00:33:34,240
I just

791
00:33:34,350 --> 00:33:35,810
cast a divination for you.

792
00:33:36,160 --> 00:33:36,960
Guess what?

793
00:33:37,160 --> 00:33:38,960
You'll pass with flying colors.

794
00:33:40,030 --> 00:33:41,400
With your grandpa's divination,

795
00:33:41,400 --> 00:33:43,460
you'll definitely nail it this time.

796
00:33:45,110 --> 00:33:45,560
Xin.

797
00:33:45,830 --> 00:33:46,560
I'm leaving.

798
00:33:51,750 --> 00:33:53,870
Hope you ace it today.

799
00:33:54,590 --> 00:33:56,350
Hope you ace it too.

800
00:33:59,350 --> 00:34:00,350
Pass with flying colors.

801
00:34:00,350 --> 00:34:02,240
-Pass with flying colors.
-Pass with flying colors.

802
00:34:02,240 --> 00:34:03,170
Perfect scores.

803
00:34:03,920 --> 00:34:04,850
Perfect scores.

804
00:34:05,250 --> 00:34:08,159
[Qingwu Town First Senior High School]

805
00:34:12,590 --> 00:34:18,400
Go, go, go!

806
00:34:18,760 --> 00:34:20,800
Sweetie! Do your best!

807
00:34:20,840 --> 00:34:21,920
Good luck, sweetie.

808
00:34:21,920 --> 00:34:23,120
Good luck. Good luck.

809
00:34:23,320 --> 00:34:25,400
Good luck. Good luck.

810
00:34:26,630 --> 00:34:27,230
I was wrong. I was wrong.

811
00:34:27,230 --> 00:34:27,550
Zihao.

812
00:34:27,550 --> 00:34:28,150
You little brat.

813
00:34:28,150 --> 00:34:29,000
It's crunch‑time for the exam!

814
00:34:29,000 --> 00:34:30,760
And you're at an internet café
playing games?

815
00:34:30,760 --> 00:34:31,320
Zihao! Zihao!

816
00:34:31,320 --> 00:34:31,880
Are you asking for a beating?

817
00:34:31,880 --> 00:34:32,280
I was wrong. I was wrong.

818
00:34:32,280 --> 00:34:33,480
Excuse me, parents can't come in.

819
00:34:33,480 --> 00:34:35,110
Come out, hurry up.

820
00:34:35,320 --> 00:34:36,320
Today's exam day.

821
00:34:36,440 --> 00:34:37,550
I rushed all the way back home

822
00:34:37,550 --> 00:34:38,480
