823
00:34:38,480 --> 00:34:39,400
I'm telling you!

824
00:34:39,400 --> 00:34:40,860
Enough. Today's the exam.

825
00:34:40,880 --> 00:34:42,480
Whatever it is, we deal with it after.

826
00:34:42,480 --> 00:34:44,000
Zihao, don't be nervous.

827
00:34:44,110 --> 00:34:45,000
Do your best later.

828
00:34:45,000 --> 00:34:46,000
I've prepared everything for you.

829
00:34:46,000 --> 00:34:47,770
Admission ticket, pens, and water.

830
00:34:47,770 --> 00:34:48,480
I don't expect you

831
00:34:48,480 --> 00:34:49,540
to get a high score.

832
00:34:49,670 --> 00:34:50,860
As long as you can get into a college

833
00:34:50,860 --> 00:34:52,190
