834
00:34:52,400 --> 00:34:52,800
Okay.

835
00:34:52,920 --> 00:34:53,670
Cheer up.

836
00:34:54,110 --> 00:34:54,920
Go on, get in there.

837
00:34:54,920 --> 00:34:55,250
Okay.

838
00:34:55,280 --> 00:34:55,670
Go ahead.

839
00:34:55,670 --> 00:34:56,760
Do your best on the exam.

840
00:34:56,760 --> 00:34:57,820
