859
00:36:16,550 --> 00:36:17,510
I'll pack my things tonight

860
00:36:17,510 --> 00:36:19,310
and head back tomorrow morning.

861
00:36:19,320 --> 00:36:20,120
Zhi, Zhi, Zhi,

862
00:36:20,400 --> 00:36:21,550
