867
00:36:27,190 --> 00:36:28,230
Piece of cake.

868
00:36:28,550 --> 00:36:30,680
I won first prize in the Math Olympiad.

869
00:36:31,740 --> 00:36:33,470
Alright, you are the best.

870
00:36:34,000 --> 00:36:34,830
Mom, Dad,

871
00:36:35,010 --> 00:36:35,670
don't forget

872
00:36:35,670 --> 00:36:36,870
what you promised me.

873
00:36:40,920 --> 00:36:42,250
What did we promise him?

874
00:36:42,440 --> 00:36:43,790
What did we promise him?

875
00:36:45,000 --> 00:36:46,150
About Cao Si.

876
00:36:46,800 --> 00:36:47,600
You promised.

877
00:36:49,610 --> 00:36:51,050
That was your dumb idea.

878
00:37:01,440 --> 00:37:02,060
Qi Shi!

879
00:37:03,590 --> 00:37:04,160
Qi Shi!

880
00:37:05,150 --> 00:37:05,550
Zhi.

881
00:37:08,400 --> 00:37:09,800
I rushed back before dawn

882
00:37:10,150 --> 00:37:11,000
and made it just before

883
00:37:11,000 --> 00:37:11,660
you went in.

884
00:37:11,910 --> 00:37:13,150
It's just a normal exam.

885
00:37:13,150 --> 00:37:14,490
You don't have to make a big deal of it.

886
00:37:14,490 --> 00:37:15,320
I wanted you to get some of my good luck

887
00:37:15,320 --> 00:37:16,250
before you enter

888
00:37:16,480 --> 00:37:17,590
the exam room.

889
00:37:19,190 --> 00:37:19,550
Zhi,

890
00:37:20,230 --> 00:37:22,030
have you told Si about you making

891
00:37:22,030 --> 00:37:23,230
the provincial team?

892
00:37:23,360 --> 00:37:23,820
Not yet.

893
00:37:24,160 --> 00:37:25,200
I'll go tell her

894
00:37:25,230 --> 00:37:26,320
right after I send you inside.

895
00:37:26,320 --> 00:37:27,440
May you know everything you're tested on,

896
00:37:27,440 --> 00:37:29,040
and guess everything right.

897
00:37:29,320 --> 00:37:30,520
Okay, okay. Just go.

898
00:37:30,550 --> 00:37:30,960
Go on.

899
00:37:30,980 --> 00:37:31,840
Go find her now.

900
00:37:32,000 --> 00:37:32,750
You go in first.

901
00:37:32,750 --> 00:37:33,890
Go, go, go.

902
00:37:34,360 --> 00:37:35,320
I'm leaving then.

903
00:37:35,320 --> 00:37:35,710
Bye.

904
00:37:36,480 --> 00:37:37,080
Good luck!

905
00:37:37,550 --> 00:37:38,030
Okay.

906
00:37:46,190 --> 00:37:46,670
Si,

907
00:37:47,150 --> 00:37:47,630
I know

908
00:37:47,890 --> 00:37:48,930
my dad taking me

909
00:37:48,960 --> 00:37:49,440
to your house last time

910
00:37:49,440 --> 00:37:50,640
must have scared you.

911
00:37:50,840 --> 00:37:51,840
But rest assured,

912
00:37:52,050 --> 00:37:53,000
my feelings for you

913
00:37:53,000 --> 00:37:54,400
are absolutely genuine.

914
00:37:55,290 --> 00:37:56,280
From now on, I'll fully

915
00:37:56,280 --> 00:37:57,600
respect your decisions.

916
00:37:57,600 --> 00:37:58,150
We can take our time

917
00:37:58,150 --> 00:37:59,750
building our relationship.

918
00:38:00,360 --> 00:38:00,840
There is no relationship

919
00:38:00,840 --> 00:38:02,190
to build between us.

920
00:38:02,590 --> 00:38:03,360
No rush, Si.

921
00:38:04,150 --> 00:38:04,710
How about we

922
00:38:04,710 --> 00:38:05,920
catch a movie tonight?

923
00:38:05,920 --> 00:38:07,030
I already bought the tickets.

924
00:38:07,030 --> 00:38:07,400
Look.

925
00:38:07,970 --> 00:38:08,480
Zhou Xuanyu.

926
00:38:08,480 --> 00:38:09,400
Zhou Xuanyu!

927
00:38:10,720 --> 00:38:11,840
How many times do I have to tell you?

928
00:38:11,840 --> 00:38:13,000
Stop bothering Si!

929
00:38:13,030 --> 00:38:13,960
Stop bothering Si!

930
00:38:13,960 --> 00:38:15,160
She is my girlfriend.

931
00:38:16,360 --> 00:38:17,690
Just because you say so?

932
00:38:18,420 --> 00:38:19,280
Si has never admitted to me

933
00:38:19,280 --> 00:38:20,810
that you're her boyfriend.

934
00:38:21,170 --> 00:38:22,800
Besides, Si isn't married.

935
00:38:24,070 --> 00:38:25,330
Let's compete fairly.

936
00:38:27,510 --> 00:38:28,810
Who wants to compete fairly with you?

937
00:38:28,810 --> 00:38:29,320
Say it now.

938
00:38:29,320 --> 00:38:31,380
Say you'll never come near her again.

939
00:38:32,000 --> 00:38:32,670
No.

940
00:38:32,790 --> 00:38:33,720
-Say it!
-Qi Zhi!

941
00:38:36,390 --> 00:38:36,830
No.

942
00:38:36,850 --> 00:38:37,780
-You…
-Qi Zhi!

943
00:38:42,720 --> 00:38:43,580
Get out of here.

944
00:38:43,800 --> 00:38:44,440
Go on, go.

945
00:38:45,220 --> 00:38:46,120
I'm telling you.

946
00:38:46,120 --> 00:38:47,230
If I see you near her again,

947
00:38:47,230 --> 00:38:48,760
I'll beat you up every time.

948
00:38:55,440 --> 00:38:56,000
Qi Zhi,

949
00:38:56,720 --> 00:38:57,520
just you wait.

950
00:39:05,480 --> 00:39:06,280
Qi Zhi,

951
00:39:07,030 --> 00:39:08,400
I'll get angry if you keep doing this.

952
00:39:08,400 --> 00:39:09,440
Why do you even bother with him?

953
00:39:09,440 --> 00:39:09,770
He...

954
00:39:11,920 --> 00:39:12,450
Besides,

955
00:39:13,590 --> 00:39:15,990
why didn't you tell me
you were coming back?

956
00:39:17,400 --> 00:39:18,550
Then wait for me a bit.

957
00:39:18,550 --> 00:39:19,890
I'll go change my clothes.

958
00:39:19,890 --> 00:39:21,230
I'll take you out for a nice meal

959
00:39:21,230 --> 00:39:22,440
to celebrate your championship.

960
00:39:22,440 --> 00:39:23,080
Besides the championship,

961
00:39:23,080 --> 00:39:23,880
I have another piece of good news

962
00:39:23,880 --> 00:39:24,340
for you.

963
00:39:24,360 --> 00:39:25,280
Come on, go, go.

964
00:39:28,230 --> 00:39:29,970
English was brutal this year.

965
00:39:30,000 --> 00:39:30,440
I guess

966
00:39:30,440 --> 00:39:31,480
I won't hit 110.

967
00:39:31,880 --> 00:39:33,320
Finishing the exam is a victory in itself.

968
00:39:33,320 --> 00:39:34,710
Why think so much about it?

969
00:39:34,710 --> 00:39:36,640
The last question is definitely C.

970
00:39:36,760 --> 00:39:38,400
No way, it's D.

971
00:39:38,960 --> 00:39:40,010
I saw a similar one

972
00:39:40,040 --> 00:39:41,240
in my practice tests.

973
00:39:41,320 --> 00:39:43,320
You definitely got the cloze wrong.

974
00:39:44,530 --> 00:39:45,360
So what if I did?

975
00:39:45,360 --> 00:39:47,420
That's just three points behind you.

976
00:39:47,920 --> 00:39:49,030
More than three points.

977
00:39:49,030 --> 00:39:50,030
Three points in English,

978
00:39:50,030 --> 00:39:51,800
ten points for that math problem,

979
00:39:51,800 --> 00:39:52,880
and then the math Olympiad—

980
00:39:52,880 --> 00:39:54,940
that adds up to nearly twenty points.

981
00:39:56,440 --> 00:39:57,630
There's still the comprehensive
science exam this afternoon.

982
00:39:57,630 --> 00:39:58,430
Just you wait.

983
00:40:00,150 --> 00:40:02,550
You don't stand a chance
in science exam either.

984
00:40:02,550 --> 00:40:04,700
Comprehensive science exam this afternoon?

985
00:40:04,700 --> 00:40:07,180
[Qi's General Store]

986
00:40:05,530 --> 00:40:07,060
Here, let me wipe it for you.

987
00:40:08,710 --> 00:40:09,480
There you go.

988
00:40:09,630 --> 00:40:10,430
Okay, thanks.

989
00:40:10,480 --> 00:40:11,120
Thank you.

990
00:40:11,880 --> 00:40:12,320
Sir,

991
00:40:13,150 --> 00:40:14,080
how much is this?

992
00:40:14,960 --> 00:40:15,490
This one.

993
00:40:15,740 --> 00:40:16,350
Five yuan.

994
00:40:16,800 --> 00:40:17,480
Five a box.

995
00:40:18,320 --> 00:40:18,980
Three yuan.

996
00:40:19,770 --> 00:40:20,630
Five a box for what?

997
00:40:20,630 --> 00:40:22,360
He's asking how much the fan is.

998
00:40:27,320 --> 00:40:27,920
Take care.

999
00:40:31,400 --> 00:40:33,230
What's wrong? What's on your mind?

1000
00:40:33,230 --> 00:40:35,090
You answered the wrong question.

1001
00:40:36,360 --> 00:40:38,190
I don't know what's gotten into me lately.

1002
00:40:38,190 --> 00:40:39,850
My right eye keeps twitching.

1003
00:40:40,510 --> 00:40:42,640
I feel like something is gonna happen.

1004
00:40:46,310 --> 00:40:48,770
You're just tired.
Sleep and you'll be fine.

1005
00:40:49,510 --> 00:40:50,310
You're tired.

1006
00:40:54,110 --> 00:40:55,170
Listen up, you two.

1007
00:40:55,710 --> 00:40:57,170
Just scare him a bit today.

1008
00:40:57,550 --> 00:40:58,710
Make him yield to me.

1009
00:40:59,150 --> 00:41:00,280
This is ridiculous.

1010
00:41:00,440 --> 00:41:01,770
Like I'm actually scared of him.

1011
00:41:01,770 --> 00:41:02,390
Right.

1012
00:41:06,070 --> 00:41:06,780
Got it?

1013
00:41:07,000 --> 00:41:07,400
Got it.

1014
00:41:07,680 --> 00:41:08,470
Got it, Boss.

1015
00:41:09,630 --> 00:41:10,230
You idiot.

1016
00:41:12,880 --> 00:41:13,610
Zhou Xuanyu.

1017
00:41:14,360 --> 00:41:14,920
You forgot

1018
00:41:14,920 --> 00:41:16,450
what I told you before, huh?

1019
00:41:16,840 --> 00:41:17,420
Qi Zhi.

1020
00:41:17,880 --> 00:41:19,540
You love fighting, don't you?

1021
00:41:19,800 --> 00:41:20,930
Think you're tough?

1022
00:41:23,440 --> 00:41:25,700
I think you're just asking for a beating.

1023
00:41:26,510 --> 00:41:26,970
Get him.

1024
00:41:28,070 --> 00:41:28,550
Qi Zhi.

1025
00:41:29,670 --> 00:41:30,800
Listen up, you.

1026
00:41:31,280 --> 00:41:32,680
Cao Si is our boss's girl.

1027
00:41:33,110 --> 00:41:34,240
-Don't...
-Damn it!

1028
00:41:35,200 --> 00:41:35,560
Go.

1029
00:41:35,590 --> 00:41:36,700
What are you waiting for? Hurry.

1030
00:41:36,700 --> 00:41:37,560
Grab his waist.

1031
00:41:39,150 --> 00:41:39,800
Damn it!

1032
00:41:42,000 --> 00:41:43,190
Get up! Get up now!

1033
00:41:43,360 --> 00:41:44,360
Get up and hit him!

1034
00:41:46,320 --> 00:41:46,920
Holy crap.

1035
00:41:48,080 --> 00:41:49,080
Oh no, oh no, oh no.

1036
00:42:26,730 --> 00:42:27,630
Qi Zhi,

1037
00:42:27,630 --> 00:42:28,670
you lost your balance.

1038
00:42:28,670 --> 00:42:29,400
Not my fault.

1039
00:42:29,880 --> 00:42:30,410
Let's go.

1040
00:42:36,190 --> 00:42:36,840
Thank you, teacher.

1041
00:42:36,840 --> 00:42:37,970
Thank you, teacher.

1042
00:42:39,210 --> 00:42:41,000
Qi Shi! Qi Shi! Qi Shi!

1043
00:42:41,550 --> 00:42:42,550
Excuse me, excuse me.

1044
00:42:42,550 --> 00:42:43,440
Qi Shi! Qi Shi!

1045
00:42:43,510 --> 00:42:44,110
Come here.

1046
00:42:45,070 --> 00:42:47,130
Zhi got into a fight with Zhou Xuanyu.

1047
00:42:47,760 --> 00:42:48,620
Looks like he's

1048
00:42:48,840 --> 00:42:50,440
really beating Zhi to death.

1049
00:42:50,550 --> 00:42:51,030
Is Zhi

1050
00:42:51,360 --> 00:42:52,820
gonna get beaten to death?

1051
00:42:53,960 --> 00:42:54,920
Hurry back!

1052
00:42:55,630 --> 00:42:56,480
You still have an exam!
